  "body": "<!-- Release notes generated using configuration in .github/release.yaml at 21.9.1 -->\n\n## What's Changed\n* 🐛 fix(upgrade): format generated notices by @gaborbernat in https://github.com/pypa/virtualenv/pull/3272\n* fix(release): preserve partial publications by @gaborbernat in https://github.com/pypa/virtualenv/pull/3279\n* docs(security): reconcile incident response by @gaborbernat in https://github.com/pypa/virtualenv/pull/3274\n* fix(ci): reject unrelated GraalPy failures by @gaborbernat in https://github.com/pypa/virtualenv/pull/3275\n* fix(fuzz): instrument Python targets in CI by @gaborbernat in https://github.com/pypa/virtualenv/pull/3276\n* fix(upgrade): check newly added wheel ages by @gaborbernat in https://github.com/pypa/virtualenv/pull/3277\n* fix(sbom): preserve format and reproducibility by @gaborbernat in https://github.com/pypa/virtualenv/pull/3278\n\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/pypa/virtualenv/compare/21.9.0...21.9.1",
